WEBVTT

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.180
Extra, Extra, Extra!

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.220
It says Naotora Momose is dead!

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.680
Is The Hyakko Party finally finished?

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.060
We can now walk the streets at night
without worry.

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:15.810
Dying in the explosion of an entire train
sure is a flashy way to go.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:23.030
Damn it. Damn it!
What have you done, Mikhail!? Damn!

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:27.570
Do you have any idea
how hard it was for me to complete that?

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.950
I only set him free from his misery.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.540
No, you could've done it differently!
Mr. Kershner, please say something!

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.210
There was a message from Mr. Yevgraf.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.550
The Ark of Sirius is not here
in the Imperial Capital.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.090
So coming here was a total waste of time.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:51.180
No, no! Isn't my research important?

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:55.140
We must be at Mr. Yevgraf's side at once.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.230
I-- I won't give up!

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.730
I got enough data,
and mass production is possible too!

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.240
For crying out loud!

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.650
-I'll never give up!
-Noisy bastard.

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:10.870
After all, his research was a failure
which just cost us money and labor.

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:15.460
But there's something left for us to do.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:19.040
It's those damn annoying bugs...

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:20.920
Jaegers.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:25.920
Here on this land,
we will destroy them completely.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:25.170
Will the next flower bloom
to your satisfaction, Yuliy?

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:30.840
-The damage is quite bad.
-Wouldn't it be better to get a new car?

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:34.890
Never mind that.
We can't inflate the repair fee, can we?

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:36.560
Don't get me involved.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:40.810
-Hey, you have grease on your face.
-Really?

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.150
Your face!

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:47.980
That's why I don't like doing oily work.

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:49.900
Just take a bath later.

00:03:49.990 --> 00:03:51.950
Let's make Yuliy help too.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.160
I'd bet he's good at this detailed work.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.330
You should leave him be for now.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.710
-They don't look alike.
-What?

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:05.750
Yuliy and his brother.

00:04:07.590 --> 00:04:09.960
It can't be good for him
to look like a Vampire.

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:14.510
So he did become a Vampire.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:17.640
Yes. He told me
that as long as I'm a Jaeger,

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:20.350
my brother and I are enemies.

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.560
He mentioned the Ark too.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.520
When I was in Dogville,
I was still young...

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:30.780
so I was told nothing about the Ark.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.860
But I'm sure my brother knows.

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:39.580
Maybe that's also why the Vampires
are keeping your brother alive.

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:41.910
What actually is the Ark?

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:45.500
What's my brother going to do
with the Ark?

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:51.210
Yuliy, do you want to quit being a Jaeger?

00:04:52.340 --> 00:04:55.590
If you do, you and your brother
won't have to kill each other.

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:58.600
Vengeance is my reason for living.

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:00.720
This is all I have.

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.270
You taught me that, professor.

00:05:04.020 --> 00:05:06.560
I don't know how I would live if I quit.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.270
I certainly taught you
how to take vengeance.

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:13.650
But is it a way to live? It's not.

00:05:15.950 --> 00:05:17.200
Mikhail, was it?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:21.240
You two share the same blood,
and he's your only brother.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.540
You have the choice to live,
and let him live too.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:29.000
-But my brother is a Vampire, and--
-What if there was a way to change that?

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.460
What if, like he said,

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:35.880
you could spare a life
or take it with the Ark?

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:41.430
If you figure something out about the Ark,

00:05:41.510 --> 00:05:43.970
maybe you'll know how to live your life.

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:46.230
But before that,

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:48.730
we must first know the Vampires' moves.

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:53.020
The humanoid weapon they created
with help from Alma Trading Company...

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:55.150
I don't know its connection to the Ark,

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:58.660
but now that it has been destroyed,
what will the Vampires do next?

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.580
LIMITED EXPRESS TRAIN
HYAKKO PARTY INVOLVEMENT

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.040
First you go out without permission,
now you say you were on this train?

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:08.290
I'm deeply sorry for worrying you.

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:09.830
Unbelievable.

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:11.540
Think of what could've happened

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:14.000
if everyone from V Shipping
hadn't been there.

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:18.380
They found this.

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.680
I have allowed your swordsmanship training

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:22.760
so you could strengthen
your mind and body,

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.350
but I forbid you
to touch a sword ever again.

00:06:26.100 --> 00:06:28.940
Being both a good warrior
and a scholar is an outdated ideal.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:31.520
You should just quietly work hard
on your studies

00:06:31.610 --> 00:06:33.320
as the next head of the family.

00:06:35.650 --> 00:06:36.860
Father...

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:40.110
there are many things in this world
you cannot understand

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:41.320
just by studying.

00:06:41.910 --> 00:06:42.740
What?

00:06:43.530 --> 00:06:45.450
I don't want that.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:50.290
I want to see more and more of this world,
experience it, and learn!

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.830
If I'm to be the next head of the family--

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:53.880
That's enough!

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:58.800
Unbelievable. Do you want to be forbidden
from going out as well?

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:01.970
Anyway,
consider your position from now on.

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:06.310
What would your mother say
if she were alive--

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:09.600
I will not!
I will not "consider my position"!

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.690
I won't quit
swordsmanship training either!

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:13.230
Hey! Hey, Ryoko! Ryoko?

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:20.030
The whole city has been talking about
The Hyakko Party all morning.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:24.200
The police hunt for the remaining radicals
shouldn't take long either.

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:25.240
I see.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.750
It's a pity to hear about
Major General Kakizaki.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:35.040
Yeah. After finishing his report,
he took full responsibility

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:37.130
and ended his life by honorable suicide.

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:40.010
I heard it was a warrior-like
and admirable end.

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:43.220
But that's not the end.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:45.760
The Alma Trading Company...

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:47.680
ALMA TRADING COMPANY ATTACKED

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:49.720
After the Japan incident a few executives,

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:52.850
including the vice president,
who was visiting from headquarters,

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:53.770
remain missing.

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:55.770
The Department of War and chiefs of staff

00:07:55.860 --> 00:07:58.320
are in a frenzy
to learn their whereabouts.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:02.610
We also have orders to search for
the Alma Trading Company executives

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:03.950
as top priority.

00:08:04.910 --> 00:08:07.080
If they're hiding here
in the Imperial Capital,

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:09.660
we are told not to hesitate
to declare martial law.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:11.910
That's a serious matter.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:13.210
I'm at a loss.

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:15.960
Postponing the V Shipping case...

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:17.170
V Shipping?

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:18.880
Weren't they innocent?

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:22.090
I heard they cooperated
with the army on the train.

00:08:24.930 --> 00:08:25.970
Vampire...

00:08:27.050 --> 00:08:28.430
No, it's nothing.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:32.390
You all proceed with the search
for the Alma executives.

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.560
Yes, sir. Where are you headed, sir?

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:38.900
I thought I'd pretend to be someone
other than a newspaper man.

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.450
A way to live other than vengeance...

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.210
All right, a new record!

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:03.880
So this is how it's used.

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:07.760
The Japanese sure use hot water
in a luxurious way.

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:09.600
Before I came here,

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:12.100
I had only heard about it
from my mother too.

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:17.100
What?

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.150
So you had a brother.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:23.650
Yeah, but I had always
thought he was dead.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:26.360
You should be happy you got to see him.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.160
He has become a Vampire.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.410
Even so...

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.920
it's a hundred times better
than never seeing him again.

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:52.720
So the sword skills
you showed on the train

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:55.180
were the fruit of your daily discipline.

00:09:55.390 --> 00:09:56.940
My father scolded me.

00:09:57.730 --> 00:09:59.900
He said I should quit
my swordsmanship training

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:01.440
and quietly work on my studies.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:02.690
Oh, that's a waste.

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:04.730
Aren't fighting women wonderful?

00:10:06.110 --> 00:10:09.360
Dorothea,
how did you get into your line of work?

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:12.910
It's not me you want to know about,
it's Yuliy, right?

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:16.250
You saying such things again...

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:21.210
Although not as wealthy as your family,
my family was fairly rich too.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:23.800
So I lived very comfortably.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.010
Then, why?

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:28.300
I happened to see it...

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:31.640
A monster that shouldn't exist
in this world.

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:34.180
A Vampire.

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:37.890
Of course.

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:42.690
If you saw such a monster,
of course you couldn't let it be.

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:45.780
Things can't stay this way,
something must be done!

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:47.650
Yes.

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:52.450
It's an amazing thing to put your life
on the line like that for others.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.990
Don't glorify me too much.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:59.620
I just couldn't hold in
the boiling impulses of my heart...

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.330
Well, I was young and thoughtless.

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:06.960
Dorothea, you have seen, heard,
and learned many things

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:08.210
from all over the world.

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:11.760
I'm so envious of that.

00:11:12.550 --> 00:11:15.140
Then, could you also teach me sometime?

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.270
"Chanbara", was it?

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:20.690
Because I don't know that.

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:24.110
Yes. It's called swordsmanship, actually.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:30.530
Yeah.
Then as usual, let's meet at the bar.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.430
-You're a new face.
-People come and go all the time.

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:57.560
You know how it is.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:02.140
I want information on the missing
Alma Trading Company executives.

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:05.520
Alma, Alma, wherever I go...

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:10.690
The train attacked by The Hyakko Party,
they were on it. I know that much.

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:13.660
I never knew that.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:18.160
If you don't know,
I'll go to someone else.

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:21.620
In that case, those executives...

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.160
Are they Vampires too?

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:28.590
Army of the Greater Japanese Empire.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.170
I'm Major Hideomi Iba.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.340
The army?

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:36.840
Tell me everything you've seen and heard.

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.600
All right. It's perfect.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:44.600
With this,
they won't complain if I charge extra.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:49.900
It's cold.

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:59.490
Damn. For the army to meddle in this...
What's happening?

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:11.670
Connect me to Yotsuya, 7036,
the Naoe mansion--

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:15.590
Oh, I'm sorry we're closed today--

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:50.590
Hey.

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:52.090
I'm all right.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:54.340
I wasn't bit.

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:57.380
But more importantly, here.

00:13:58.930 --> 00:13:59.890
They came...

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:03.510
Vampires... they want to...

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:05.520
You all...

00:14:12.730 --> 00:14:17.110
I wanted to drink your mockingbird
one last time.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:44.180
-Professor is late.
-Yes, put me through.

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:46.060
Is he still drinking at this hour?

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:47.850
Professor?

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:49.810
Yes.

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:51.940
Yes.

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:55.480
I understand.
Professor, please be careful too.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:58.650
The Vampires are coming.

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:01.490
All right.

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.660
We don't have to look for them anymore.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:06.580
Hurry. See how many people
are in the mansion, and evacuate.

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:09.620
Then, set traps at all entrances
and exits in the house,

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:11.670
-and around the premises.
-Got it!

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.170
Yuliy...

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.670
I have a favor to ask.

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:18.800
Oh, no...

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:21.760
Is there a place you can hide
in the house?

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:25.600
Maybe the warehouse of the annex.
But why me?

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:28.930
I want you to ask the Baron
to take everyone in the house

00:15:29.020 --> 00:15:30.020
and evacuate there.

00:15:30.940 --> 00:15:33.350
Since you've actually seen
and fought a Vampire,

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:34.940
I think you can convince him.

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:39.110
-Yuliy...
-That's what Dorothea told me to say.

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:42.030
Oh, is that so?

00:15:45.410 --> 00:15:46.490
I understand.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.950
Should I evacuate as well?

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:53.040
No, please protect your father
and everyone else.

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:56.040
Everybody has said you are very strong.

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.210
Yes!

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:01.800
Wha-- What are you doing, sir?

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:05.470
Oh, just setting a trap
to exterminate vermin.

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:09.520
It'll be dangerous tonight
so you'd better not go outside.

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:13.770
What-- What is that, Ryoko?
What is that outfit?

00:16:14.560 --> 00:16:16.900
Monsters are coming to attack this house.

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:20.110
-What are you talking about?
-It's true!

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.570
We must evacuate
to the warehouse immediately.

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:24.910
Alas! This can't be happening.

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:29.830
-Father, you know about the monsters too?
-Ryoko, you have finally lost your mind.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:32.500
No-- No, I haven't!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:37.290
-What's this? A blackout?
-Father!

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.300
Please, hurry!

00:16:39.550 --> 00:16:40.590
Father!

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:46.430
Here they come.

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:49.430
With guns, our positions will be exposed.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:01.190
Come on now, you dirty Vampires.

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:04.900
I'll dispense with them quickly
then maybe take another bath.

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.620
Do you want to kill me too, Philip?

00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:15.410
Because a fellow from my tribe
killed your parents.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.170
Why ask that now?

00:17:22.090 --> 00:17:23.090
I don't know...

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:28.050
<i>When I think about it now,</i>
<i>your tribe had nothing to do with it.</i>

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:30.390
<i>It was only...</i>

00:17:31.390 --> 00:17:33.060
<i>Only bad luck.</i>

00:17:56.250 --> 00:17:57.500
<i>Don't you want vengeance?</i>

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:02.420
Don't you think of killing everyone
related to who killed your parents?

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:04.090
I did think so.

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:08.260
But like Saki said,
you're not to blame, Yuliy.

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:11.220
Isn't it the same with your brother?

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:13.970
Vampires may be your enemy,

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:17.140
but does that make your brother
an enemy too?

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:29.950
They're walking into our traps.

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.040
It stopped.

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.720
-Piece of cake.
-Fallon.

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.270
They're not coming.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:01.190
-Well, now, did they go home?
-They're here.

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:03.940
They're nearby.

00:19:04.190 --> 00:19:08.190
-What? Where? There's no place to hide.
-I smell them for sure.

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:27.920
Damn. Retreat for now.

00:19:34.930 --> 00:19:35.760
Philip!

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.310
Yuliy!

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:47.270
This is bad.
They brought everyone they've got!

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:49.320
Let's join Dorothea's group.

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:51.700
Hey, a fire. Fire!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:53.200
Which mansion?

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.830
That's Mr. Naoe's mansion!

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:02.920
It seems the most amazing stage
has been set for us...

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:05.880
Shall we begin?

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:14.470
What on earth--
What on earth is happening, Ryoko?

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.680
Everyone from V Shipping is fighting.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:19.640
What? What do you mean?

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:23.270
In the time of need, I'll be the bait...

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:26.020
Please gather everyone
and run while you can.

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:29.530
Don't say such foolish things.
I'll never allow you to go!

00:20:29.610 --> 00:20:31.690
I have the responsibility
to protect everyone

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:33.280
as the next head of the house!

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:36.450
What father would be happy
being protected by his daughter?

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:38.240
I will go!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:45.120
Ryoko, if anything happened to you,
what would I say to your late mother?

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:47.290
Father?

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:50.760
This isn't good.

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:53.130
I still haven't sent home
this month's allowance.

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:56.260
But if you die,
they'll receive insurance money.

00:20:57.600 --> 00:20:58.470
That's not funny.

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:03.390
Damn.
The fire is spreading to the mansion!

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:10.780
Kershner.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:14.150
A big fish has appeared, Yuliy.

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:16.780
Yuliy...

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:21.580
So, you're the Sirius survivor.

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:26.000
I, Kershner, will personally take
your last breath from you.

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.500
You should feel honored.

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:29.500
Hey, don't ignore me.

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:31.800
Mikhail!

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:35.470
Philip!

00:21:38.140 --> 00:21:41.100
Your opponent is me!

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:06.120
You fool.

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:09.880
You should've just abandoned
this spineless human.

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:11.590
Yu-- Yuliy.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:13.130
Run.

00:22:15.170 --> 00:22:16.010
Yeah, I will...

00:22:17.220 --> 00:22:18.720
but with you, Philip!

00:22:23.600 --> 00:22:24.970
EPISODE 6
MOCKINGBIRD'S SONG

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:04.660
<i>We obtained an ancient document.</i>

00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:07.450
<i>-It concerns the survival of the Empire.</i>
<i>-You were there,</i>

00:24:07.530 --> 00:24:09.700
<i>-so I survived!</i>
<i>-You say it exists?</i>

00:24:09.790 --> 00:24:10.750
<i>It was a long time!</i>

00:24:10.830 --> 00:24:12.040
EPISODE 7
TRUE CONFESSION

00:24:21.720 --> 00:24:25.050
Subtitle translation by Haruna Saito
